lingmo-kwin (5:6.0.21.lingmo5u1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * fix(multitaskview): resolve memory leak and startup lag
    - add unrefVisibleEx() in onWindowClosed/onWindowDeleted to balance
      refVisibleEx() in onWindowAdded; windows closed during multitasking
      view were never unref'd, causing +50-100MB retained per cycle
    - remove synchronous D-Bus call to imageblur service in
      getWorkspaceBgPath(); blocked render thread once per desktop×screen
      on every open; now uses cache-first lookup with async fallback
    - reuse MultiViewWorkspace/MultiViewAddButton/tipFrames across
      open/close cycles; initWorkspaceBackground() updates in-place
      instead of delete+recreate, eliminating QML scene churn

 -- Lingmo OS Team <team@lingmo.org>  Tue, 20 Oct 2026 18:00:00 +0800

lingmo-kwin (5:6.0.20.lingmo5u1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * fix: 降低多任务视图的内存占用与打开卡顿
    - 背景缓存每 (桌面,屏幕) 只保留当前壁纸一条（原先留 3 条）。缓存里是整屏
      尺寸的 pixmap（4K 单张约 33MB），多余条目在关闭视图后也不会释放
    - 不再在 cleanup() 里销毁 9 个 QML 效果框。createEffectFrame() 本来就是
      “只创建一次”的写法，但 cleanup() 把它们置空销毁，导致每次开关多任务视图
      都要销毁并重建 9 个 QML 场景，既拖慢打开又持续吃内存；现在对象只创建一次，
      属性每次进入视图重新下发

 -- Lingmo OS Team <team@lingmo.org>  Wed, 14 Oct 2026 16:03:45 +0800

lingmo-kwin (5:6.0.19.lingmo5u1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * fix: 修复多任务视图背景缓存无上限导致 kwin 内存持续增长
    - MultiViewBackgroundManager 的 m_wpCachedPixmaps/m_bgCachedPixmaps
      以 “壁纸 uri + 桌面 + 屏幕” 为键，且从不清理，换壁纸就会留下
      一整份屏幕尺寸的 pixmap（1080p 约 8MB、4K 约 33MB）
    - 改为按 (桌面,屏幕) 记录 uri 顺序，只保留最近 3 个

 -- Lingmo OS Team <team@lingmo.org>  Tue, 13 Oct 2026 23:58:57 +0800

